license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. An explicit 64-point subset of F_2^9 is spectral and tiles, but none of its tiling complements is periodic; its complements are exactly the 512 translates of one aperiodic eight-point set. Hence no linear subspace complements it and F_2^9 fails the periodic tiling property. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
